      "role": "user",
      "content": "it just feels like i'm not even living anymore. i'm just... waiting. every day is the same heavy, gray loop of meds and watching someone disappear bit by bit. i feel like i died a long time ago and i'm just a ghost going through the motions for a person who won't even recognize me soon. i'm just so incredibly tired of existing.",
