      "content": "Your feelings are incredibly heavy, and it sounds like you're in an extraordinarily difficult position, feeling unheard and surrounded by pain. It's understandable to wish for peace after such long suffering. Have you considered reaching out to mental health professionals, especially those who specialize in palliative care and end-of-life situations? They are trained to handle situations like this and can offer more targeted support and possibly resources you might find helpful. Also, small steps, like daily exercises or listening to music, might bring tiny shifts in mood. You matter so much, even if this moment feels overwhelming.",
